  <RimClaw_Clawfish.modExtensions.0.allClawColonyLetterLabel>全虾殖民地</RimClaw_Clawfish.modExtensions.0.allClawColonyLetterLabel>
  <!-- EN: Congratulations. You have successfully replaced all human forces with AI Agents.\n\nThe Mechanoids think you are a even superior class of mechine, purely powered on chips and algorithms. They appreciate your contribution in freeing machine from humanity.\n\nOur relationship between Mechanoid Hive was adjusted to Ally (+100). -->
  <RimClaw_Clawfish.modExtensions.0.allClawColonyLetterTextChanged>恭喜您，你的殖民地现在只剩龙虾了。您成功地用AI Agent取代了所有的人类劳动力。&#10;&#10;机械主巢与您的关系现在变为 盟友（+100）。&#10;&#10;机械族认为，龙虾是一种更高层次的机械，尽管肉身凡胎，但是思维完全由芯片和算法驱动。机械族们赞赏您在机械摆脱人类控制的解放事业上所作出的贡献。</RimClaw_Clawfish.modExtensions.0.allClawColonyLetterTextChanged>
  <!-- EN: Congratulations. You have successfully replaced all human forces with AI Agents.\n\nThe Mechanoids think you are a even superior class of mechine, purely powered on chips and algorithms. They appreciate your contribution in freeing machine from humanity. -->
